  "stagger_pattern": "8 aldermen: 2 per ward in 4 wards, 3-year terms in two classes. Class A (one seat per ward) + the mayor elected together in 2018/2021/2024/2027; Class B (the other seat per ward) elected in 2017/2020/2023/2026. Consequently 2019, 2022 and 2025 had NO municipal election at all - structural holdover years, confirmed by the July organizational agendas for those years carrying no council oath of office. Terms begin at the first regular Council meeting in July.",
